# bulk GaAs

units           metal
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 10 delay 0 check no

read_data	./GaAs4096atoms

pair_style	deepmd ./GaAs-semi.pb
pair_coeff  * *	Ga As

mass            1 69.72
mass            2 74.92

group           Ga  type 1
group           As  type 2

velocity        all create 300 23456789
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nvt temp 300 2000 0.1

thermo_style    custom step pe ke etotal temp press vol 
thermo          50
dump        1 all custom 50 GaAs-2000k.xyz id type x y z

run            3000000
